      "id": "mathematical-ability-03-001",
      "number": 1,
      "question": "Simplify: (16 ÷ 4) × 5 - 3 + 2",
      "options": {
        "A": "19",
        "B": "20",
        "C": "15",
        "D": "17"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "BODMAS Rule: 4 × 5 - 3 + 2 ⇒ 20 - 3 + 2 ⇒ 17 + 2 = 19.",
      "hash": "1301eec363218f6a",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "सरल करें: (16 ÷ 4) × 5 - 3 + 2",
          "options": {
            "A": "19",
            "B": "20",
            "C": "15",
            "D": "17"
          },
          "explanation": "BODMAS नियम: 4 × 5 - 3 + 2 ⇒ 20 - 3 + 2 ⇒ 17 + 2 = 19."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mathematical-ability-03-002",
      "number": 2,
      "question": "The ratio of two numbers is 3:4 and their sum is 28. What is the larger number?",
      "options": {
        "A": "12",
        "B": "16",
        "C": "14",
        "D": "20"
      },
      "answer": "B",
      "explanation": "3x + 4x = 7x = 28 ⇒ x = 4. Larger number = 4x = 4 × 4 = 16.",
      "hash": "f8ef2017255a4aeb",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "दो संख्याओं का अनुपात 3:4 है और उनका योग 28 है। बड़ी संख्या क्या है?",
          "options": {
            "A": "12",
            "B": "16",
            "C": "14",
            "D": "20"
          },
          "explanation": "3x + 4x = 7x = 28 ⇒ x = 4। बड़ी संख्या = 4x = 4 × 4 = 16।"
        }
      }
    },
    {
